user.description:
Only two things are needed: your e-mail address and the password. The mail server is worked out from the address.

{lepesek}

The tracker only reads: nothing is deleted, moved or marked as read. The password stays in Home Assistant (not in the tracker's backup). After saving it looks for the last six months' bills and assigns them to your accounts; anything uncertain is asked on the panel. {jelszo_megjegyzes}

email_hiba.description:
Can't log in to the "{postafiok}" mailbox of {otthon}, so bills arriving by e-mail are not imported.

Problem: {hiba}

**Fix:** Settings → Devices & services → Rezsikövető → {otthon} → "{postafiok}" → ⋮ → Reconfigure and enter the password again (Gmail: a new app password at {gmail_url}). The issue disappears once login works; other mailboxes and the accounts keep working.
